# Accessibility

When creating or editing UI:

1. Read `.agents/skills/accessibility/SKILL.md`
2. For fixes: `.agents/skills/fixing-accessibility/SKILL.md`
3. Semantic HTML, keyboard focus, labels for forms, alt text for images
4. Review requests: `.agents/skills/web-design-guidelines/SKILL.md`

Do not skip a11y for "quick" components in `@repo/ui`.
